    "title": "PHOTOS: Lady Raiders vs. Montgomery Central - NewsBreak",
    "text": "ROCKINGHAM — Starting its regular season Wednesday, the Richmond Senior High School girls’ tennis team hosted Montgomery Central. The Lady Raiders weren’t able to begin with a victory and lost 7-2 to the Lady Timberwolves. Richmond’s two victories came in singles play. No. 4 freshman Molly Covington and No. 6 sophomore Erin Drumwright each notched a win in her high school debut. Click here to read more about Wednesday’s season opener. Richmond (0-1) has its second match of the season at Union Pines High School Monday at 4 p.m.",
